#@ HEADER
#@ NAME         diffev_best.mac
#@ 
#@ KEYWORD      diffev, best member, initialize
#@ 
#@ DESCRIPTION  This macro contains the parameters for the current best
#@ DESCRIPTION  member. If run the best member will be recreated.
#@ DESCRIPTION  As the random state is explicitely contained as well, the
#@ DESCRIPTION  best member will be recreated exactly.
#@ DESCRIPTION
#@ DESCRIPTION  This macro uses the original macro on the run_mpi command
#@ DESCRIPTION  line. Make sure to turn on writing of desired output files.
#@
#@ PARAMETER    $0, 0
#@
#@ USAGE        @diffev_best.mac
#@
#@ END
#
